      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "CBP is on the ball when it comes to stopping fake goods this FIFAWorldCup2026! We’re working hard to target and inspect counterfeit sports merch, keeping it from making its way to fans.\n\nAs of June 29, 2026, there have been 1,684 seizures with 341,231 pieces seized by @CBP that infringe on the associated intellectual properties to the FIFA World Cup with a MSRP of $27,034,416. And we keep scoring big wins - we’re seizing counterfeit jerseys, hats, soccer balls, and other goods at U.S. ports every day. \n\nWe’re keeping the merchandise game fair so you can root for your favorite team with confidence.\n\nLearn more about counterfeits: https://t.co/qKCqPdjiEv \n\n#CBPxFIFA2026",
